    ///
    /// # Return value
    ///
    /// - [`cusolverStatus_t::CUSOLVER_STATUS_ALLOC_FAILED`]: The resources could not be allocated.
    /// - [`cusolverStatus_t::CUSOLVER_STATUS_SUCCESS`]: The structure was initialized successfully.
