    ///
    /// The parameter `S` also contains singular values of each matrix in contiguous way,
    /// $$
    /// \begin{split}S = \begin{pmatrix}
    /// {S0} & {S1} & \cdots \\\\
    /// \end{pmatrix}\end{split}
